# The Earth Crystal: "{4}{G}{G}, {T}: Distribute two +1/+1 counters among one or two target creatures you control." The
# targets and their shares are announced as it is activated, each target at least one (CR 601.2d by way of 602.2b; the
# ruling). Turn 5: two Black Lotus mana, Forest, Llanowar Elves and Mox Emerald pay exactly; Bot2's Elvish Mystic can't be
# a target, nor can the two counters be given two and none. One each goes to Grizzly Bears and Llanowar Elves, and Bot1
# bolts the Elves in response: the Elves' share is lost, not given to the Bears (the ruling, CR 608.2b), and the Bears'
# one is doubled by the Crystal's own replacement: 2. Turn 7: both counters on the Bears alone, doubled to 4: 6 in all.

